  "story": {
    "day": 47,
    "title": "A Special Family Photo",
    "sentences": [
      "On a cold Thursday in February, Kaya looked at old pictures.",
      "She saw a great photo from New Year's Day in Hong Kong.",
      "Her young cousin played with some beautiful fruit.",
      "He was usually shy, but he looked very happy.",
      "Tall and smart, her uncle looked like a busy office worker.",
      "Kaya's brother made a funny face for the camera.",
      "He was short, so he stood on a box.",
      "Kaya asked, \"Mom, was this a fun time?\"",
      "Her mom said, \"Uh-huh, everyone was very friendly.\"",
      "Next, they saw a picture of a special dish.",
      "It was not an elementary school lunch recipe.",
      "They loved eating the delicious meal together."
    ]
  }
}